{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*******important note*******</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning the earthbending system used in this game is not easy. It is advised to focus while playing the tutorial. Also you should watch bending tutorial videos on my youtube channel. If you don't want to commit to this intense learning, then I do not recommend you to play this game. If you ignore this note, then you will complain, that the hitboxes don't work, while you don't even throw an attack on the enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first finished and published game so far. Although I did my best, you should not expect AAA quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*******important note*******</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/de7cba19c79ebf8e0222cc0a5bc563c1.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earthling of Gaia is played in the first person perspective in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does count as action game, because the core game mode is to defeat waves of enemies. It's a simple wave defense game. It is important to know, that this game is just a small game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main weapon against the incoming enemies will be your earthbending skills. You can manipulate the earth around you by using the motion of your hands. Once an enemy is hit by a stone, he will be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/3e235a8768bb1cd42bc740eed4d436c7.poster.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/3e235a8768bb1cd42bc740eed4d436c7.webm?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/3e235a8768bb1cd42bc740eed4d436c7.mp4?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is even waterbending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/febc3a6320d9f2ed6b9c07a7a5555196.poster.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/febc3a6320d9f2ed6b9c07a7a5555196.webm?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/febc3a6320d9f2ed6b9c07a7a5555196.mp4?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to defend your precious goddess Gaia. You will win, if you stop all incoming waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/dea5f58ca0654fd5d17cdd06856b3df3.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with different difficulty settings. If you are just here for role playing, you can play on easy mode. If you are here for a challenge, you can play on the impossible mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/a7953230e5661363fd22e1f4bb06b31d.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different ways how to use your earthbending skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/302e0639eee10f378c1f29802ab30d6a.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the trailer for additional information about the earthbending system used in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Me:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a young solo developer. I developed this game in my free time, while working a full time job. I did not study game development. All my knowledge comes from online tutorials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although I give my best to to deliver you the most impressive gaming experience, I cannot promise that I am able to fix all bugs or keep a high quality standard compared to other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Infos:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can only be played with a virtual reality headset and associated controllers for each hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The VR-device should have a joystick for moving. For Rotation the game supports snap turning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only a single player mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846320?t=1760268365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760268365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/26289362f19c8ced0f60a0533734982dba1df84a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760268365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/26289362f19c8ced0f60a0533734982dba1df84a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760268365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*******important note*******</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning the earthbending system used in this game is not easy. It is advised to focus while playing the tutorial. Also you should watch bending tutorial videos on my youtube channel. If you don't want to commit to this intense learning, then I do not recommend you to play this game. If you ignore this note, then you will complain, that the hitboxes don't work, while you don't even throw an attack on the enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first finished and published game so far. Although I did my best, you should not expect AAA quality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*******important note*******</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/de7cba19c79ebf8e0222cc0a5bc563c1.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earthling of Gaia is played in the first person perspective in VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It does count as action game, because the core game mode is to defeat waves of enemies. It's a simple wave defense game. It is important to know, that this game is just a small game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main weapon against the incoming enemies will be your earthbending skills. You can manipulate the earth around you by using the motion of your hands. Once an enemy is hit by a stone, he will be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/3e235a8768bb1cd42bc740eed4d436c7.poster.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/3e235a8768bb1cd42bc740eed4d436c7.webm?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/3e235a8768bb1cd42bc740eed4d436c7.mp4?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is even waterbending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/febc3a6320d9f2ed6b9c07a7a5555196.poster.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/febc3a6320d9f2ed6b9c07a7a5555196.webm?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/febc3a6320d9f2ed6b9c07a7a5555196.mp4?t=1760268365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to defend your precious goddess Gaia. You will win, if you stop all incoming waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/dea5f58ca0654fd5d17cdd06856b3df3.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game comes with different difficulty settings. If you are just here for role playing, you can play on easy mode. If you are here for a challenge, you can play on the impossible mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/a7953230e5661363fd22e1f4bb06b31d.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different ways how to use your earthbending skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/extras/302e0639eee10f378c1f29802ab30d6a.avif?t=1760268365\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the trailer for additional information about the earthbending system used in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Me:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a young solo developer. I developed this game in my free time, while working a full time job. I did not study game development. All my knowledge comes from online tutorials. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although I give my best to to deliver you the most impressive gaming experience, I cannot promise that I am able to fix all bugs or keep a high quality standard compared to other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Infos:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can only be played with a virtual reality headset and associated controllers for each hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The VR-device should have a joystick for moving. For Rotation the game supports snap turning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only a single player mode.</p>","developers":["imakumi-industries"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846320/header.jpg?t=1760268365","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2846320/748917/e8104bc0c88aa0009352679a9a073570252e68c7/1750947161/dash_av1.mpd?t=1725097890","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2846320/748917/e8104bc0c88aa0009352679a9a073570252e68c7/1750947161/dash_h264.mpd?t=1725097890","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2846320/748917/e8104bc0c88aa0009352679a9a073570252e68c7/1750947161/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1725097890","id":257051135,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051135/movie480.mp4?t=1725097890","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051135/movie_max.mp4?t=1725097890"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257051135/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1725097890","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051135/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1725097890","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257051135/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1725097890"}}],"name":"Earthling of Gaia","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Earthling of Gaia - $2.99 USD","packageid":1015519,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_c